{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415764","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415764","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041576401:1":{"text":"Y-Your feathers...","source_cn":"你、你的羽毛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD75C971ED5FF5984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576402:1":{"text":"What about them?","source_cn":"我的羽毛怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED891EAE07B0B82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576403:1":{"text":"So red... Like they've been... burned by fire.","source_cn":"好红……像是……被火烧过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2219B699A3A3A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576404:1":{"text":"They were. My old feathers were consumed by flames so that these could be born from the ashes.","source_cn":"它们的确是旧羽焚尽后，浴火而生的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55D32B7068451315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576405:1":{"text":"Why use fire? Did you hate the way they were before?","source_cn":"为什么要用火……？你讨厌原本的它们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC31C1F7F2127A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576406:1":{"text":"No, I treasure my feathers dearly.","source_cn":"不，我很珍爱我的羽毛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4474D66ABAFD647A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576407:1":{"text":"But just as a falcon must molt, old feathers must fall away before new ones can grow.","source_cn":"至于为什么，正如鹰隼也要经历换羽一般，旧的羽毛逝去，新...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2AE882ADFF6525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576408:1":{"text":"What if... the old feathers are torn out... and the new ones never grow back?","source_cn":"要是，旧的羽毛，拔光，新的羽毛，不长出来呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15AD49AB93C48CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576409:1":{"text":"... What you're describing sounds like some kind of illness.","source_cn":"你说的……是一种疾病？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x225AAFDFDB6E7301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576410:1":{"text":"Not illness. A choice... he made himself.","source_cn":"不是病，是他做出的，选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x578DC1FFF87AC630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576411:1":{"text":"I see... So the person you're speaking of chose this by his own will?","source_cn":"也就是说……这是你口中之人自己的意志？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07AB5CDF4B13FBFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576412:1":{"text":"Got it...","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576413:1":{"text":"But... why?","source_cn":"但，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EA70126C683D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576414:1":{"text":"If soaring through the skies is our destiny, and the sky is our paradise...","source_cn":"如果说，翱翔于天是我们的命运，天空是我们的乐园……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DDED4875F7E421D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576415:1":{"text":"Then there will always be those unwilling to let fate carry them wherever it pleases... unwilling to be dragged into the unknown.","source_cn":"也会有人不甘于让命运推着走，不甘于让命运带自己到未知里去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x388B27EADDF99A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576416:1":{"text":"At first, everyone believes they can defy fate.","source_cn":"一开始的时候，人都会觉得自己能违抗命运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0283F66DC4B510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576417:1":{"text":"In the end... perhaps some truly do. Others, perhaps not.","source_cn":"到最后，或许真的可以，又或许不然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9019BBD6C2DF86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576418:1":{"text":"Have you ever made such a choice yourself? And did you regret it?","source_cn":"你有做出过你的选择吗？你会为之后悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2396BA4FD5B9C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576419:1":{"text":"Yes. I have no regrets.","source_cn":"有。不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B1DB0F0114519F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576420:1":{"text":"Oh...","source_cn":"这样啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA95676176E850B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041576421:1":{"text":"Then perhaps the man you speak of is not so different from you after all.","source_cn":"你口中的他，又何尝不是另一个你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECFED7950060E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡兹姆":{"text":"Kazim","source":"卡兹姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"Talene","source":"塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":2}}